        <span itemprop="definition">Example 1 Resin Ultra high Content proportion (%) 30 20 20 30 40 composition polyethylene (Mw( ⁇ 10 3 ), f( ⁇ 1M)) 2700, 46% 2700, 46% 2700, 46% 2700, 46% 2700, 46% High density Content proportion (%) 70 80 80 70 60 polyethylene (Mw( ⁇ 10 3 ), f( ⁇ 1M)) 260, 5.0% 260, 5.0% 260, 5.0% 260, 5.0% Solid content concentration (%) 30 30 30 30 23</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0174">
